---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Amsterdam Flames" description="Nikhil Kulkarni as Head of Digital and Technology for Amsterdam Flames — building the entire digital and technology foundation for Season 1 of a new European cricket franchise.">

  <div class="page-header">
    <p class="page-label">AI &amp; Product</p>
    <h1>Amsterdam Flames</h1>
    <p class="intro">Head of Digital and Technology for Amsterdam Flames — a new cricket franchise in a new tournament, building the entire digital and technology foundation from scratch.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">

    <section class="role-section">
      <div class="role-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Head of Digital and Technology</h2>
          <p class="role-meta">June – November 2026 · Sydney / Netherlands</p>
        </div>
        <span class="role-badge">Most recent</span>
      </div>
      <p>Amsterdam Flames is a Netherlands-based T20 cricket franchise competing in the European T20 Premier League. I joined as Head of Digital and Technology for Season 1, responsible for building the club's entire digital and technology foundation from the ground up — website, membership platform, merchandise store, fan engagement tools, and the CRM and data infrastructure behind all of it.</p>
      <p>Amsterdam Flames is a startup like no other. I've worked in plenty of startups, but building a cricket franchise in a brand new European tournament — with a team based across Australia and the world — was something else entirely. With a very lean team, we went from idea to live across the full platform, with AI as a genuine building partner throughout. The highlight? Watching fans hold up their phones at the ground and show off their founding member badges.</p>
      <p>A great combination of my love of cricket and my background in technology.</p>
    </section>

  </div>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .page-label {
    font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c2613f;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .intro {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .content { max-width: 760px; }

  .role-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .role-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .role-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .role-meta {
    font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .role-badge {
    font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: #fdf5f2;
    color: #c2613f;
    border: 1px solid #c2613f;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  p {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #474747;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  strong { color: #1a1a1a; }
</style>
